msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん。<br>クガネに旅立った先生からは、まだ連絡がありません。<br>迷子になっていなければいいのですが……。
#. de: Wir haben nichts von dem Gildenmeister gehört, seit er nach Kugane aufgebrochen ist. Ich hoffe, er hat sich nicht verlaufen<nbsp>... und ihm ist hoffentlich nichts zugestoßen.
#. fr: Le maître n'a pas donné la moindre nouvelle depuis qu'il est parti pour Kugane. J'espèrrre qu'il ne s'est pas perdu en chemin...
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_000:1"
msgid "We've had no word from the guildmaster since he left for Kugane. I do hope he hasn't gotten lost...or worse."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん。<br>マスクカーニバルは私に任せて、<br>クガネにいる先生を手伝ってあげてくださいな。
#. de: Ich habe hier alles unter Kontrolle, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Es klingt, als wäre Martyn derjenige, der wirklich gerade deine Hilfe gebrauchen könnte.
#. fr: Les spectateurs de la Grande Mascarade peuvent bien se contenter d'un seul Bleuet masqué pendant quelque temps. Ne vous en faites pas pour ça, et parrrtez rejoindre le maître à Kugane.
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_010:1"
msgid "I have everything under control here, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. It sounds like Martyn's the one who really needs your help right now."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さんなら、<br>きっとゴゴを倒せると私は信じていますよ！
#. de: Es ist mir egal, wie gut dieser Gogo zu sein glaubt. Ein armseliger Imitator hat keine Chance gegen dich, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>!
#. fr: Ce n'est que mon avis, mais je suis perrrsuadée que vous valez mieux que ce Gogo, <if $gn4>Madame<else>Monsieur</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>!
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_020:1"
msgid "I don't care how good this Gogo thinks he is, no paltry imitator stands a chance against you, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: お待ちしていましたよ、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん!
#. de: Ein dreifaches Hoch auf <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>!
#. fr: Brrravo pour votre victoire, <if $gn4>Madame<else>Monsieur</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>!
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_030:1"
msgid "Three cheers for <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: すみません、新たな<ruby>敵役<rt>ヒール</ruby>探しの旅に出た先生からは、<br>まだ連絡が来てないです。
#. de: Es tut mir wirklich leid, aber ich hab bisher noch keine Neuigkeiten von Meister Martyn erhalten.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoirrr<else>Bonjourrr</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjourrr<else>Bonsoirrr</if></if> <if $gn4>Madame<else>Monsieur</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Je suis désolée, je n'ai aucune nouvelle de maître Martyn pour l'instant...
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_040:1"
msgid "Still no word from Martyn, but never fear─it shouldn't be long before he's found a prospective rival for you."
msgstr ""

#. ja: リムサ・ロミンサにいる先生のことを、<br>どうかよろしくお願いします。
#. de: Richte Meister Martyn in Limsa doch bitte meine Grüße aus!
#. fr: Alors<nbsp>? Vous avez trouvé votre prochain rival<nbsp>? Ah bon, pas encorrre...
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_050:1"
msgid "I can only imagine what Martyn is up to in Limsa, but you'll look after him, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 先生、巴術士ギルドで調子に乗ってなかったですか？<br>絶対、先輩風を吹かすタイプですよ。
#. de: Meister Martyn hat sich in der Hermetikergilde doch bestimmt wie der größte Magier aller Zeiten aufgespielt, oder? Er ist eben nicht der Bescheidenste<nbsp>...
#. fr: Alors comme ça, le maîtrrre est un ancien élève de la guilde des arcanistes... Je suis sûre qu'il a pris son rôle de mentor très à cœur<nbsp>! Le connaissant, il ne manquerait pas une occasion de flatter son ego, hihi<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_060:1"
msgid "The Arcanists' Guild? He wasn't offering more of his private lessons again, was he? Given the opportunity to flaunt his knowledge, the man simply can't help himself."
msgstr ""

#. ja: グリダニアにいる先生に、<br>どうか付き合ってあげてください。
#. de: Schau doch bitte bei dem Meister in Gridania nach dem Rechten.
#. fr: Le maîtrrre vous a demandé de le rejoindre à Gridania, vous vous souvenez<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_070:1"
msgid "Martyn said he has a good feeling about Gridania. I certainly hope he's right."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 先生、野盗にかけられた懸賞金を狙っていたそうですね。<br>フッフッフ……青魔道士仲間から情報は筒抜けですよ。
#. de: Diesmal war der Meister also in Wirklichkeit hinter dem Kopfgeld des Banditen her! Woher ich das weiß? Hehehe, wir Blaumagier hegen eben engen Kontakt untereinander<nbsp>...
#. fr: Le maîtrrre est in<shy>cor<shy>ri<shy>gi<shy>ble... Il a prétexté vouloir embaucher le voleur, mais il n'en avait qu'après la prime sur sa tête, pas vrrrai<nbsp>? Hihi, je le sais car j'ai entendu d'autres élèves de la guilde en parler<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_080:1"
msgid "I heard Martyn was actually after a bounty, is that right? Somehow I'm not surprised."
msgstr ""

#. ja: イシュガルドにいる先生に、<br>どうか力を貸してあげてください。
#. de: Ob der Meister wohl in den eisigen Höhen Ishgards fündig geworden ist? Ich erwarte deinen Bericht!
#. fr: Je compte sur vous pour venir en aide au maîtrrre à Ishgard<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_090:1"
msgid "He wasn't ruffling any feathers at the stables, was he? Surely not..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 先生の<ruby>敵役<rt>ヒール</ruby>、どんな風になるか楽しみですね……！
#. de: Wie aufregend! Ich bin schon ganz gespannt auf die Antagonistenrolle des Meisters.
#. fr: Je suis très curieuse de voir sous quelle forme le maîtrrre va devenir votre rival<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_100:1"
msgid "To be honest, it's hard to picture Martyn as a villain, even if he's only acting."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 先生に手加減は無用ですよ。<br>ゴールドルをケチョンケチョンにしてやってください！
#. de: Halt dich bitte nicht zurück! Gib alles und wisch mit Goldor den Boden auf!
#. fr: J'ai trop hâte de vous voir combattre, <if $gn4>Madame<else>Monsieur</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Goldor est sournois, mais je sais que vous pouvez le vaincre<nbsp>! Vous allez l'<i>écrabouillanter</i><nbsp>! Ah, et ne vous inquiétez pas pour maître Martyn, il a la tête durrre<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_110:1"
msgid "By the sounds of it, Royse has afforded Martyn more than an unfair advantage, so don't worry about holding back."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 素晴らしかったです、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん！
#. de: Was für eine Vorstellung! Ich bin hin und weg!
#. fr: Vous avez été <i>fantastibuleu<if $gn4>se<else>x</if></i>, <if $gn4>Madame<else>Monsieur</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>!
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/008/CtsEtcAozPyandihTalk_00847:TEXT_CTSETCAOZPYANDIHTALK_00847_PYANDIH_000_120:1"
msgid "You were absolutely brilliant, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! I can scarcely remember the last time the Celestium was so lively."
msgstr ""
